9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.mp4?t=1770472761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important parts of Teddy the Tractor is the tractor. You will ride your tractor, upgrade it, unlock new weapons, and fight Teddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, you move through the story by committing quests and collecting crops day by day. Time moves forward constantly, and some quests can be missed or failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight various tractorheads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect corn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tractor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Teddy the Tractor\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/cb20556bc3b1cd16ba9e52fd487905b9099802bc/header.jpg?t=1770472761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/1782844098/b07173eb970af49676e0b2a986bd2bedd5e47829/1770133162/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770136361","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/1782844098/b07173eb970af49676e0b2a986bd2bedd5e47829/1770133162/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770136361","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/1782844098/b07173eb970af49676e0b2a986bd2bedd5e47829/1770133162/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770136361","id":257059531,"name":"Early teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257059531/d7635a70d9f591f1b34a8c1ec6dbebb19ceeb553